  body: "# Qualifying disability payment in the CA definition\n\n## Authored interpretation\n\nFor CA, the source’s
    definition of a severely disabled person refers to specified payable benefits or components, rather than a diagnosis
    alone.\n\n## Scope and exceptions\n\nDMG 60033 spans pages 4–5 and refers to Memo 02/25, Scottish payments and
    an EU-equivalent benefit. The list and weekly-rate requirement must be read in full. Do not equate DLA mobility
    with DLA care or treat this as a generic definition of disability. DMG 60050’s shorter hospital list needs reconciliation
    with the expanded definition.\n\n## Inspected passages\n\n- [DMG 60033, PDF page 4](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e0fdcbb5e95ca5017ed9da/dmg-Chap-60.pdf#page=4).\n\
    \n## Additional context\n\n- [Context: chapter 60, PDF page 5](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e0fdcbb5e95ca5017ed9da/dmg-Chap-60.pdf#page=5).\n\
    - [Context: chapter 60, PDF page 8](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e0fdcbb5e95ca5017ed9da/dmg-Chap-60.pdf#page=8).\n\
    \n## Evidence and review status\n\nIndependent experimental interpretation of captured DWP guidance, not an
    official DWP document. Definitions and semantic associations are model-assisted proposals awaiting specialist
    review. No individual entitlement decision, medical conclusion, award calculation or executable rule is provided.\n\
    \nSource observation, listing-page update, printed revision, legal event and claimant-event dates are separate.
    Current legal applicability is unresolved. Page numbers are one-based PDF positions; machine extraction may
    damage reading order, characters and footnotes. No visual PDF or specialist acceptance is claimed.\n\n- `dmg-vol10-ch60`:
    PDF `ab9fed933c167b4ac18039204c3853c425731ffb4239022a11b41884caaee22a`; extracted pages `bc5925c0d434fbc4bec575bea2e1e2dbd020b014497ab156973054e80e326f2f`;
    acquired `2026-09-15T19:45:32.596227Z`.\n"
  resource: https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e0fdcbb5e95ca5017ed9da/dmg-Chap-60.pdf#page=4
